WEBVTT

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:09.690
This is...

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:10.900
What the?

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:15.660
Nerval.

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:26.500
W-What?

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.130
Ul, that's...?

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.920
Judging by its design, it looks like it's from a previous era.

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:31.630
Stay alert.

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:32.300
Roger!

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:39.100
ICP Battle Formation, Counter-Attack Mode.

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:39.760
Roger.

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.480
It's not taking any damage.

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:46.020
Well, compared to that it's only a pea-shooter.

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:55.450
Nerval.

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:07.290
The ICP are a nuisance.

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:11.130
Akiha, the Golden Orb. Get it before it recovers.

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:12.550
Eh? We're still getting it?

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:14.340
Ojou-sama!

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.090
Imo-chan.

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:16.130
Are you all right?

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:17.430
It's dangerous out here.

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:19.930
Oh well, let's just go together.

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:20.260
Yes.

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:22.010
We've still got to steal it.

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:29.930
Flying through space, freely, gracefully

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:33.630
On the shoulders and in the heart, the girl has wings

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:37.320
The world she was born into is beautiful

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:40.970
Even a goddess cannot rule

00:01:44.110 --> 00:01:48.380
That dream on a star born in darkness,

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:51.280
it won't shine by just watching.

00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:55.740
My body becomes a spaceship,

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:59.000
and climbs to the atmosphere of my thoughts

00:01:58.870 --> 00:02:13.760
If I try to resign to calmness, my heart will bug up.

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:17.480
Hey, with your rocket,

00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:20.920
can you change my path?

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:24.850
By being connected together, we confirm

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:30.390
we aren't androids

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:34.340
Across the rainbow, to the future to someone

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:38.060
If wishing will get me there, I will gradually start believing

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:41.720
The world we march into is limitless

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:45.390
Even God cannot destroy it all

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:50.530
And one day even the sins people made will disappear

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:56.290
Dispatch notice to all units:

00:02:56.290 --> 00:03:00.050
To all units assigned to traffic control in the blue squadron, area 1060 has been sealed off.

00:03:00.590 --> 00:03:05.050
The Golden Soul Shouts

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:04.880
Why are they all edgy over an alarm from an abandoned factory?

00:03:04.880 --> 00:03:05.590
Who knows...

00:03:05.590 --> 00:03:08.140
Maybe it's connected to the incident involving the blown-up colony?

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:10.140
Whatever...

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:11.810
I wonder what it is anyway.

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:15.810
Well, all we have to do is sit and watch.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:18.730
What's this?

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:21.780
If the remote control crew are here, there is no need for us to...

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:32.540
Are you all right, Ul?

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:34.290
Damn, what now?

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:45.130
Do it now.

00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:45.800
Roger!

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:57.520
Hey, red QT-Arms, what are you doing?!

00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:00.440
Sorry. My hands are kind of full...

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:01.900
That's not what I meant!

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:03.780
If you take that you'll be committing a crime!

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:05.610
Ah, so it was one...

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:09.030
Of course it is. I have a mountain of questions to ask y...

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:16.000
Is that all right?

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:17.500
She's from the ICP.

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:18.920
The ICP are a nuisance.

00:04:20.170 --> 00:04:21.710
Not good, let's hurry.

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:25.380
Ah, geez!

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:29.130
H-Hold it right there!

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:31.760
Ah... This is...

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:33.470
This is bad, we need to withdraw.

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:34.220
Roger!

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:42.440
Go ahead first.

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:43.860
First?

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:45.400
Don't stop.

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:55.370
The structure containing Nerval is being destroyed.

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:57.250
Huh? What was that thing?

00:04:57.250 --> 00:04:59.120
Deliver the Golden Orb to Leopard.

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:01.830
Geez, why won't they tell me what Nerval is?

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:03.880
Ojou-sama, look up!

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:06.960
The ICP! Why?

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:09.130
They're all beaten up.

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:19.810
That guy, huh?

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:22.860
I have control!

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:24.970
Releasing stealth.

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:31.110
Bring me my source of power quickly.

00:05:31.110 --> 00:05:32.280
Leopard...

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:44.250
We're still being chased.

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:47.210
This is the biggest mess the ICP has ever been involved in...

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:50.880
There it is.

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:52.130
In such a place...

00:05:57.390 --> 00:06:00.640
Rise out of the Metropolis, and head towards the central tower.

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:05.920
Over there.

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:15.950
Put the Golden Orb on the platform there.

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:17.950
This will be difficult.

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:19.790
Image. Make an Image.

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:22.290
Ojou-sama, you're really skilled!

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:25.380
That hurt!

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:28.300
Hey! Be more gentle!

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:30.800
That desperate pain...

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:31.880
I don't understand at all.

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:44.190
It's here, it's here, it's here, it's here! The power has come!

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:48.650
W-What?

00:06:57.660 --> 00:06:58.740
It's shining...

00:07:08.130 --> 00:07:09.130
What do you want?

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:10.550
Hold up the Golden Gun.

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:16.390
Aim at the big clock and fire.

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:19.810
Isn't that...

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:23.310
Leopard?

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:36.530
Well then... let's go!

00:07:56.930 --> 00:07:58.590
Imo-chan, wait in there.

00:07:58.590 --> 00:07:59.930
Now, fire.

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:01.850
I'm the only one who can beat him.

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:03.770
It can't be helped then...

00:08:03.770 --> 00:08:05.850
This will be the last time, ok?

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:22.870
I... am the greatest heart of a colony in history... Leopard-sama!

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:27.960
Take it. My Soul Shouts!

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:48.640
Antimatter cannon...

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:50.520
So he finally shot it...

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:55.610
Leopard!

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:05.450
Leopard?

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:19.300
Akiha Ojou-sama!

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:21.050
Are you all right?

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:23.140
No... My body is in pain.

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:24.680
In the country,

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:27.350
the frogs jump at the summer insects.

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:32.810
The sounds of the organ, the whisper of the birds in the clear blue sky.

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:34.150
Huh?

00:09:34.150 --> 00:09:40.200
On the other hand, I don't mind the smell coming from the person who was fried to a crisp.

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:43.660
I'm now in a very relaxed mood.

00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:45.490
What kind of mood?

00:09:45.490 --> 00:09:51.290
For a man, it's sort of like the pure white combustion of reaching longevity.

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:53.880
Did you know about it?

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:56.090
Yes. How comforting it is...

00:09:56.090 --> 00:09:58.460
Alright, time to scan some tea.

00:09:58.460 --> 00:10:01.300
Go bring me that tea bag.

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:07.060
Not you, tea girl. I'm talking to you, Imo! Number two.

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:12.810
Number two?!

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:13.400
What?

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:15.150
What are you trying to imply?!

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:16.940
Treating others lowly,

00:10:16.940 --> 00:10:18.650
who do you think you are?

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:20.650
You're just a dung beetle!

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:21.280
No!

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:21.990
You're not even a dung beetle!

00:10:21.990 --> 00:10:23.820
You're just the dung that the dung beetle pushes around.

00:10:23.820 --> 00:10:26.160
Poop. Poop. Poop!

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:27.830
That's what you are.

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:30.200
And what's the deal with being a Tea Meister?

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:32.940
You are just a piece of stinky copper whose sense of taste is bad and manners are rude,

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:34.630
is that what a Meister is?

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:37.340
It's better if you don't drink tea at all!

00:10:37.340 --> 00:10:39.130
Acting pretty despite being empty on the inside.

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:43.200
You can rot as a useless person along with your useless ideals, you rotten person!

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:52.810
Ah! What have I done.

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:56.190
Ojou-sama...

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:56.190
It's all right... Calm down.

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:59.230
Hey! What are you going to do if I break?

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:02.030
My heart is very delicate.

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:05.990
Where are you going?

00:11:05.990 --> 00:11:08.080
I'm going back and contacting the ICP.

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:10.040
This is out of my control already.

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:11.790
What did you say?

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:13.750
I don't want to have anything to do with you!

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:16.630
Hey, wait. Burned Akiha. Number two.

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:18.880
Did you just say number two?!

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:20.240
Not at all...

00:11:22.710 --> 00:11:24.970
The King needs his Queen.

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:26.970
What are you talking about?

00:11:26.970 --> 00:11:29.260
I can't stick around any more.

00:11:33.730 --> 00:11:35.060
He needs...

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:39.060
Leopard needs a partner.

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:41.610
No way.

00:11:49.570 --> 00:11:53.580
Sign: Recovery costs are covered by the national fund too

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:56.080
Just what were you thinking?

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:56.080
Sign: Paranormal Department

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:59.840
I should have told you to "investigate," rather than "engage..."

00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:02.920
That was... in self defense...

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:03.950
Be quiet.

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:08.260
Write a debriefing report and then go home and reflect upon it.

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:11.850
Ch-Chief... That's not fair... I was-

00:12:11.850 --> 00:12:18.020
We at ICP are part of an organization. Independent action is forbidden.

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:21.110
I will keep investigating even if I'm alone.

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:22.770
Kannagi, stop right there.

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:23.860
That is a bad idea.

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:25.650
Excuse me.

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:28.610
Kannagi.

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:31.700
It's unexpected that she would rebel.

00:12:31.700 --> 00:12:34.950
Bougainvillea, Mintao. Restrain Kannagi.

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:35.790
Yes sir.

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:40.250
Gee, it was such a horrible day.

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:45.010
I think it's better not to associate with them.

00:12:45.670 --> 00:12:48.630
We might as well go to the ICP and inform them.

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:52.010
But I wouldn't mind riding the cable car...

00:12:52.890 --> 00:12:57.020
N-No... I ought to cut all ties with that rude AI.

00:13:00.190 --> 00:13:05.010
Somehow, those tears were very deep.

00:13:05.860 --> 00:13:07.530
On to the next story.

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:13.410
Reports have confirmed the existence of the unknown colony from a previous era.

00:13:14.010 --> 00:13:20.250
Today the ICP submitted their report at the command meeting of the Kirkwood Structure.

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:22.330
According to the report-

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:35.060
Nina, why?

00:13:39.940 --> 00:13:41.600
This is...

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:47.760
Ouch...

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:57.660
D-D-D-D-D-Dead... She's dead!

00:13:57.660 --> 00:14:00.080
Y-Y-You... Did you do it?

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:02.120
Blood!

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:03.920
Wait for me!

00:14:33.030 --> 00:14:35.320
I thought we were done for, Min-chan.

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:37.330
But she was.

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:39.330
Maybe she was beaten up.

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:41.000
No one knows.

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:42.210
The way she was killed.

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:44.330
The body wasn't found.

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:45.290
Ever heard of zombies?

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:49.550
Nina, wasn't there an easier way?

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:52.010
Let's just wish for peace for Itsuki-kun now.

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:57.050
Hope that her soul will soar free in space wearing this ribbon.

00:14:57.050 --> 00:14:59.060
Stop. Don't make me remember it.

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:01.520
I too will go underground.

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:03.940
She's not wearing a collar anymore...

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:08.010
Calm down everyone.

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:10.780
It's not surprising that you're all startled,

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:13.510
there's another transfer student that I want to introduce today.

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:18.520
Due to her father's sudden work dispatch, she will be attending with us.

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:22.370
I'm Kanna- Shimoyama Mutsumi.

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:25.670
As of now, I am assig- I mean, transferred here.

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:27.530
Pleased to work with you.

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:31.960
Eh... She's quite pretty.

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:33.700
But it somehow feels unnatural.

00:15:35.010 --> 00:15:37.540
Then you can take that free seat...

00:15:43.890 --> 00:15:48.060
Shishidou Akiha-san, take this. Please accept it.

00:15:48.060 --> 00:15:49.560
For me?

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:53.110
It's an exchange diary.

00:15:53.110 --> 00:15:55.720
Rules of usage are written on the first page.

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:57.240
An exchange diary?

00:15:58.450 --> 00:16:01.330
Erm... What...

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:04.330
What's with her...

00:16:09.590 --> 00:16:13.050
Director, about the transfer student...

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:14.550
Director.

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:18.090
I'm listening. If you want Shimoyama Mutsumi's file, it's over there.

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:21.300
What? Did she do anything inappropriate in class?

00:16:21.300 --> 00:16:23.100
No, nothing in particular.

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:26.310
But if it's through Nee-san then...

00:16:26.310 --> 00:16:27.230
Nothing much...

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:29.060
Didn't I tell you not to call me Nee-san in school?

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:31.940
Rules.

00:16:31.940 --> 00:16:35.820
This diary belongs to Shishidou Akiha and Shimoyama Mutsumi.

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:41.320
It is meant for recording and data collection.

00:16:41.320 --> 00:16:44.870
The diary is not allowed to be read by a third party.

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:49.120
Shimoyama-san, here you go.

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:51.040
Have you written in it already?

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:55.880
Sorry. I can't do it

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:59.550
I'm a weak writer...

00:16:59.550 --> 00:17:01.970
Do you hate me?

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:04.640
N-No no... I don't mean it like that.

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:10.400
Then you don't object to having a relationship where we can tell each other anything?

00:17:10.400 --> 00:17:11.940
Anything is a little...

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:12.560
Oh yeah!

00:17:12.560 --> 00:17:16.110
Come to think of it, how did you know my name in the first place?

00:17:17.150 --> 00:17:19.070
I-It's because I like you...

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:19.900
Like?

00:17:19.900 --> 00:17:22.910
That's right. I like you.

00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:24.780
I want to be good friends with you.

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:27.160
I want to know more and more about you.

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:32.170
That's it! That's great! A forbidden love!

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:35.800
Wild rose, chrysanthemum, like a sunflower too~

00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:35.800
That's lesbianism...

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:40.550
So, did you learn anything?

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:44.300
About that... Acting like a normal high school girl,

00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:46.680
I thought I researched it well but...

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:48.390
It's quite difficult.

00:17:48.390 --> 00:17:52.280
Yes. Human relationships are difficult to handle.

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:55.110
After all, the opposite party is from the Shishidou family.

00:17:55.110 --> 00:18:00.280
If this gets out of hand, we will be exposed as well.

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:01.820
I understand.

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:04.320
For Nina, who let me infiltrate,

00:18:04.320 --> 00:18:07.990
and for the sake of the Paranormal Department, I will complete this mission smoothly.

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:09.750
Don't be too reckless.

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:10.870
Don't worry, Ul.

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:12.000
See you later.

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:12.790
Itsuki.

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:13.580
Yes?

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:16.960
Was that outfit recommended by Nina? It looks good on you.

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:19.420
Ul, you also look very occult-like.

00:18:19.420 --> 00:18:20.550
What?

00:18:20.550 --> 00:18:21.880
It looks mysterious.

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:25.010
You really have changed.

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:29.520
Take this chance to learn to act your age too.

00:18:34.350 --> 00:18:35.190
Shishidou-san.

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:35.770
Yes?

00:18:36.650 --> 00:18:37.820
I have something to talk to you about.

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:38.950
Yes.

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:42.570
Please.

00:18:42.570 --> 00:18:46.120
Please trust me and recognize our relationship.

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:49.700
Why do you want to have a close relationship with me?

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:51.120
Because I like you.

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:54.000
I would like to know more about you.

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:58.670
I'm sorry. I don't understand what you mean.

00:18:58.670 --> 00:19:00.380
It feels like you're hiding something.

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:01.670
Hiding something?

00:19:01.670 --> 00:19:03.630
Doing it this discreetly...

00:19:03.630 --> 00:19:05.970
I'm unable to trust you.

00:19:08.430 --> 00:19:09.390
I understand.

00:19:11.160 --> 00:19:14.230
Then if I show you that I'm not hiding anything,

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:16.400
you will trust me, right?

00:19:18.020 --> 00:19:19.380
Hold on...

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:24.990
Hold it right there!

00:19:24.990 --> 00:19:26.530
Don't stop me.

00:19:26.530 --> 00:19:29.280
All I want is to gain your trust.

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:31.160
A thief!

00:19:31.740 --> 00:19:33.120
My textbook has been stolen.

00:19:33.120 --> 00:19:35.000
Someone stop her!

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:36.620
A student?!

00:19:37.630 --> 00:19:39.420
A suspicious person wearing a mask?

00:19:39.420 --> 00:19:40.040
Got it!

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:42.880
Shimoyama-san...

00:19:43.970 --> 00:19:45.130
Your clothes! Clothes!

00:19:48.260 --> 00:19:49.300
Stop right now!

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:01.610
You're from the same class...

00:20:02.480 --> 00:20:03.900
The ICP is a nuisance.

00:20:03.900 --> 00:20:07.030
Who are you? How do you know about me?

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:09.240
Don't even think of laying a finger on Leopard.

00:20:10.490 --> 00:20:11.030
Die!

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:17.370
This power...

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:20.590
On the rooftop...

00:20:33.890 --> 00:20:37.230
What's going on? This is terrible.

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:39.730
Isn't this Honoka-chan's?

00:20:41.860 --> 00:20:44.530
The King and Queen are incomplete.

00:20:44.530 --> 00:20:45.530
Are you there?

00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:46.690
Honoka-chan.

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:52.700
Honoka-chan, what did you do to Shimoyama-san?

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:55.250
It has nothing to do with you.

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:56.370
Huh?

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:01.200
What do you mean "nothing to do with me..."

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:04.550
Of course it involves me!

00:21:16.230 --> 00:21:17.600
What are you doing?

00:21:18.390 --> 00:21:19.560
Why?

00:21:21.270 --> 00:21:22.270
Seriously...

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:23.860
Here you go.

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:25.880
Shimoyama-san too.

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:27.860
Put some clothes on first.

00:21:38.220 --> 00:21:41.520
Umm... Where have I seen her before?

00:21:48.420 --> 00:21:50.930
Hey, what's wrong? Your eyes are red.

00:21:50.930 --> 00:21:52.640
Nothing's wrong, Ul.

00:21:52.640 --> 00:21:54.260
I'm patched up already.

00:21:54.260 --> 00:21:56.510
Tomorrow, I will be one hundred times more energetic.

00:21:56.510 --> 00:21:59.680
Let me know who made you cry, I'll teach him a lesson.

00:21:59.680 --> 00:22:01.390
Speaking of which,

00:22:01.390 --> 00:22:02.980
this looks like it will be quite difficult.

00:22:02.980 --> 00:22:05.440
Yo. The two from the ICP.

00:22:08.620 --> 00:22:11.070
You... Who are you?

00:22:11.070 --> 00:22:13.110
I won't stop you.

00:22:13.110 --> 00:22:17.500
It is just that those from Level Free know stuff others don't.

00:22:19.040 --> 00:22:22.960
They've left it all to us, but they're curious.

00:22:23.870 --> 00:22:27.630
The Pilot of the X QT-Arms I fought is in the same class as me.

00:22:27.630 --> 00:22:29.960
Don't you ever say goodbye...

00:22:38.510 --> 00:22:44.210
My heart is on a trip,

00:22:43.970 --> 00:22:50.160
Blooming at the number of stars that no one has seen

00:22:50.250 --> 00:22:55.940
With unstoppable curiosity,

00:22:55.660 --> 00:22:58.460
I want to go with you,

00:22:57.860 --> 00:23:01.550
in a shuttle flying through the past and future

00:23:01.170 --> 00:23:06.690
Advancing forward, don't stop us.

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:12.900
Trying to change tomorrow is fine, right?

00:23:12.850 --> 00:23:18.430
Go on, with the excited feeling

00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:24.890
you found from the answer found when you were lost.

00:23:24.570 --> 00:23:30.830
Jump from Earth! Encounters are the galaxies' crossroads

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:36.700
Isn't coincidence's prank pleasant?

00:23:36.330 --> 00:23:39.500
Suddenly jumping boundlessly

00:23:39.230 --> 00:23:42.390
Friends of space

00:23:42.140 --> 00:23:48.110
Journeys do become a habit, don't they?

00:23:47.980 --> 00:23:53.740
Journeys and girls are the same...

00:23:53.710 --> 00:23:55.770
Ya know!

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:15.030
Those Who Do Not Obey

00:24:00.930 --> 00:24:04.350
Suddenly being thrown into space can actually be quite terrifying.

00:24:04.350 --> 00:24:06.050
Even though it's hard to breath and it hurts,

00:24:06.050 --> 00:24:07.520
we get to see the truth about space.

00:24:07.520 --> 00:24:08.270
Truth?

00:24:08.270 --> 00:24:08.940
Yes.

00:24:08.940 --> 00:24:11.360
On the other side of the river, my grandmother who passed away was waving to me.

00:24:11.360 --> 00:24:12.400
That's stupid!

00:24:12.400 --> 00:24:15.030
It's impossible to have a river in space.
